%[text] The ![Try this icon](text:image:7c0a)  and  ![Exercise icon](text:image:6667) icons refer to two different types of interactive activities that you will find in this script. The ![Try this icon](text:image:5901)  usually indicates an interaction where you will explore the visualization of some concept introduced in this script. The ![Exercise icon](text:image:8c12) interactions are designed to challenge your understanding of those concepts and may be used for grading and completion checks by your professor.
